<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><em><strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0TYq9RjdYYU">Sweeping cobwebs from the edges of my mind</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0TYq9RjdYYU">Had to get away to see what we could find</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0TYq9RjdYYU">Hope the days that lie ahead</a><br />
