</div>
<hr />
<p>(Thanks to LordStonefish for the music suggestion)</p>
<p>After my incredibly depressing 001, here's something optimistic for the 4K about human agency.</p>
<p>With thanks to the following:</p>
<p>modernmajorgeneral<br />
GermanderBassist<br />
Modern Erasmus<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-129496-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-129496-1')">1</a></sup><br />
Roget<br />
Neptune</p>
<p>The image is licensed to one Mike Prince, and can be found under a Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 Generic license <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lamp_inside_carpet_shop_(4781414131).jpg">here</a>. It has been modified by me in order to make it look like a much older photo.</p>
<p>N.B.: This was originally entitled &quot;A Lantern for Kashgar&quot;.</p>
<p>You can find more of my stuff <a href="/tufto-personnel-file">here</a>.</p>
<div class="footnotes-footer">
