			<div class="content" id="post-content-3859382">
									

<p>I like this, a lot. The imagery is fun, but I can't really share the opinion that this is a positive ending&#8212; Or at least, that humans are actually able to be 'happy' all the time. It reeks to me of a lotus eater machine, and honestly I don't think you intended it but that made this a very creeping kind of horror to me, because it's easy to know you'd fall into it too.</p>
<p>I love how this and your 001 are inverses of one another, but both based from a sort of&#8230; Rejection of the mechanics of reality. The former chooses to find and endless dream, while the latter chooses to crush hope because then the pain is at least expected.</p>

